# Java / Maven
api/target/
*.class

# Node / Vite
ui/node_modules/
ui/dist/
npm-debug.log*

# Env overrides (commit .env.example, not .env)
.env

# Campaign send logs (bind-mounted from the api container) — operational data,
# and they contain recipient addresses.
logs/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# No database contents in this repo. Ever.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# This repo holds code, schema and infrastructure. It does not hold a copy of the
# data: the history was rewritten on 2026-08-22 to remove the dumps it used to
# carry, and these rules are what stop them coming back. Dumps are taken with
# backup-db.bat, which lives outside the checkout - see db/CLOUD.md.
#
# Deliberately broad, and deliberately by extension rather than by path: the
# failure this guards against is someone dropping a dump into a folder nobody
# thought to list. A migration under db/migration is the one legitimate .sql that
# is checked in, and it is not matched here because it is schema, not data.
*.dump
*.sql.gz
*.backup
db-backup-*/
db-export/
**/dumps/

# Connection strings pasted while setting up a hosted database. Their real home is
# .env, ignored above - this is here so a scratch file on the way there cannot be
# committed by accident. A password in git history is a password you have to rotate.
db/creds.txt
*creds*.txt
*.credentials

# OS / editor
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/
*.iml
